WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
This surging power...

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.073 --> 00:31.160
Black Jack

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.685 --> 00:59.376
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.376 --> 01:01.369
will be there

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
It makes me glad...

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
yokatta

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
That I found my place here.

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.127 --> 01:13.645
Oh WISDOM

01:13.645 --> 01:15.494
will be there

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
I searched for the reason

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
sagashita

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
as long as we're alive.

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.678 --> 01:34.763
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.847 --> 01:37.031
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.183 --> 01:39.794
His name is Black Jack.

02:06.189 --> 02:09.743
Traffic is lighter than usual, so it looks
like we can finish early tonight.

02:11.069 --> 02:13.195
Aren't you driving a little too fast?

02:13.196 --> 02:15.485
This is nothing. We'll be fine.

02:15.865 --> 02:17.908
Don't you want to get home sooner too?

02:17.909 --> 02:19.982
Yes, but...

02:26.793 --> 02:28.210
A cop!

02:35.969 --> 02:38.077
Oh, it's just a statue.

02:38.346 --> 02:40.486
Man. That really scared me.

02:40.765 --> 02:44.393
It made my heart jump when it appeared
so suddenly in the dark.

02:53.111 --> 02:56.280
Originally "A Statue and a Policeman” by Tezuka Osamu.

02:53.111 --> 02:56.280
A Statue and a Policeman

03:08.751 --> 03:09.668
Hey!

03:10.170 --> 03:12.479
You there! Stop!

03:14.507 --> 03:16.216
You ran a red light!

03:16.217 --> 03:19.052
We didn't run any red lights!

03:19.053 --> 03:21.013
A kid wouldn't know!

03:21.014 --> 03:22.973
I'm not a kid,

03:22.974 --> 03:24.964
you scumbag!

03:25.310 --> 03:27.602
What an ill-mannered child!

03:28.146 --> 03:33.566
I'm eighteen years old!

03:33.735 --> 03:38.267
So I'm not a kid, you hear me?!

03:38.437 --> 03:40.699
The light hadn't turned red yet.

03:41.019 --> 03:41.849
What?!

03:42.076 --> 03:44.244
Like father like daughter!

03:44.245 --> 03:46.359
Like we said, we didn't run a red light!

03:46.581 --> 03:51.666
Anyway, as you passed through the intersection,
the light turned from yellow to red.

03:52.176 --> 03:54.838
If that isn't running a red light, then what is?

03:54.839 --> 03:56.506
But with that timing...

03:56.716 --> 03:59.094
You ran it, so it's your fault!

03:59.552 --> 04:01.223
You'll need to pay the fine.

04:01.638 --> 04:02.701
Your name and address?

04:08.728 --> 04:10.024
Shirt. Good.

04:14.025 --> 04:15.961
Do you want to get a drink on the way home?

04:16.144 --> 04:17.319
Sounds good.

04:17.445 --> 04:18.570
We haven't done that in a while.

04:18.571 --> 04:21.031
Let's go before Suzuta-senpai, who's
always so naggy, gets here.

04:21.032 --> 04:21.875
Hey!

04:23.910 --> 04:25.410
Suzuta-senpai!

04:26.204 --> 04:27.120
Good work.

04:27.121 --> 04:28.330
Thank you, sir!

04:42.720 --> 04:44.376
Sorry. Did you wait long?

04:44.555 --> 04:46.570
We were supposed to meet here at 7:00.

04:46.766 --> 04:47.891
You're seven minutes late.

04:48.351 --> 04:49.803
I said I'm sorry!

04:50.436 --> 04:51.805
This is the third time.

04:52.272 --> 04:53.855
You're a repeat offender.

04:53.856 --> 04:54.989
But...

04:57.434 --> 05:01.050
I was late because I couldn't decide on how to fix my hair.

05:01.531 --> 05:03.604
Who cares about how your hair looks?

05:03.825 --> 05:05.642
Keeping a promise is more important.

05:06.327 --> 05:09.561
But I wanted to look my best for you.

05:10.188 --> 05:14.121
Besides, you should show up at the
agreed upon time more often.

05:17.595 --> 05:21.010
I suggest you plan out your time more thoroughly.

05:23.344 --> 05:25.554
You don't have proper table manners either.

05:25.555 --> 05:27.014
You already spilled something four times already.

05:31.102 --> 05:31.641
What's wrong?

05:32.166 --> 05:33.020
Bathroom?

05:33.855 --> 05:34.781
I can't stand this any longer.

05:47.160 --> 05:48.107
Good work.

06:02.216 --> 06:05.415
I got dumped today.

06:10.808 --> 06:13.477
You look so worn out.

06:14.103 --> 06:19.251
You must have been standing here for
a long time, helping out us policemen.

06:23.488 --> 06:25.734
Thank you for maintaining traffic order every day!

06:38.878 --> 06:40.534
Hey, good work.

06:58.147 --> 07:00.148
I'll wipe you off too.

07:14.956 --> 07:17.541
Who would have pulled such a prank?!

07:19.210 --> 07:20.333
Poor thing.

07:20.795 --> 07:22.587
I'll clean you right up.

07:22.588 --> 07:23.672
This morning...

07:24.549 --> 07:25.924
Here you go.

07:25.925 --> 07:28.771
Sorry I couldn't protect you.

07:29.011 --> 07:30.220
Dammit!

07:30.221 --> 07:33.140
I won't let those scumbags get away with this!

07:30.503 --> 07:31.503
Oh dear...

07:42.775 --> 07:44.641
Oh, you're back?

07:45.278 --> 07:47.882
You could at least tell me.

07:48.156 --> 07:48.805
I'm home.

07:52.798 --> 07:54.211
What's the matter?

07:54.371 --> 07:55.264
Why are you asking?

07:55.537 --> 07:57.457
You look upset.

08:01.002 --> 08:04.988
Someone used markers to write all over the statue's face.

08:05.381 --> 08:06.006
More please.

08:08.426 --> 08:10.093
The statue, huh?

08:17.768 --> 08:22.814
Is it the only one you talk to sometimes?

08:22.815 --> 08:25.358
38, 39, 40...

08:25.359 --> 08:29.279
Well, I guess it's good to take care of something.

08:29.280 --> 08:33.725
Anyway, I hope you'll find someone you can marry soon.

08:34.327 --> 08:37.370
So? Any possibilities?

08:37.900 --> 08:38.733
Not a chance.

08:39.113 --> 08:40.845
It's not for me.

08:41.125 --> 08:44.305
Don't talk about yourself like that.

08:45.000 --> 08:49.132
I can because it's about myself.

08:51.886 --> 08:55.680
Please settle down soon and make me feel better.

08:56.039 --> 08:57.039
50.

08:57.679 --> 08:58.233
1...

09:02.605 --> 09:05.239
That cop was so frantic!

09:05.399 --> 09:06.942
Serves him right!

09:06.984 --> 09:10.195
He's stricter towards us citizens than that statue!

09:10.196 --> 09:11.650
What a bunch of crap!

09:12.865 --> 09:17.346
I got my license suspended because of
him, which got me fired from my job.

09:18.996 --> 09:22.707
A cab driver with a suspended license is basically useless.

09:22.708 --> 09:26.503
But what can you do? You were speeding.

09:26.504 --> 09:27.443
Shut up!

09:29.423 --> 09:34.427
I begged him to let me go just
once, but he wouldn't listen.

09:37.723 --> 09:41.338
I got written up by him in the middle of
a date, then got dumped right after.

09:41.644 --> 09:43.186
Wasn't it just a parking violation?

09:43.354 --> 09:44.938
That's not much to get written up for!

09:44.939 --> 09:46.773
That annoying cop!

09:48.067 --> 09:49.442
Give me back my job!

09:49.443 --> 09:50.610
I hate him!

09:50.611 --> 09:52.112
Dammit!

09:52.989 --> 09:54.948
I still don't feel any better about it.

09:54.949 --> 09:55.965
Of course not!

09:55.965 --> 09:57.325
That cocky cop!

09:57.326 --> 09:58.368
Want to do it?

09:58.369 --> 09:58.933
Yeah!

10:17.346 --> 10:18.973
<i>Not too much. Not too little...</i>

10:19.507 --> 10:20.288
Good.

10:29.191 --> 10:30.391
Good.

10:31.485 --> 10:32.484
I'm off.

10:32.987 --> 10:34.654
Have a good day.

10:38.618 --> 10:41.536
He was talking to it again yesterday.

10:41.537 --> 10:44.372
He looked at its face and apologized.

10:44.373 --> 10:45.123
Oh my!

10:45.385 --> 10:46.583
Sh!

10:47.168 --> 10:48.335
Good morning.

10:48.502 --> 10:49.751
Good morning.

11:02.767 --> 11:03.933
Wh-Wh...

11:03.976 --> 11:08.313
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What in the world?!

11:10.983 --> 11:12.817
You poor thing.

11:13.402 --> 11:15.727
Was it the same punks from yesterday?

11:15.988 --> 11:17.847
Damn persistent punks!

11:27.333 --> 11:29.626
<i>By now, he must be...</i>

11:31.629 --> 11:33.088
<i>Could he?! Again?!</i>

11:36.522 --> 11:38.799
<i>What if he's in trouble again?</i>

11:41.555 --> 11:44.336
Oh no!

11:45.439 --> 11:47.060
Back up, everyone!

11:47.061 --> 11:48.638
Come on! Back up!

11:50.356 --> 11:51.759
Hey, you there!

11:51.982 --> 11:53.213
I said go back!

11:53.567 --> 11:54.526
Hey!

11:54.527 --> 11:55.518
Listen to me!

11:55.546 --> 11:56.109
Oh...

11:57.113 --> 11:58.009
You again?

11:58.280 --> 12:00.073
That's what I was about to ask you.

12:00.741 --> 12:03.502
How many times do I need to tell you?!

12:03.744 --> 12:06.603
Isn't it your fault today? For not doing your job?

12:07.460 --> 12:08.382
Quiet!

12:08.541 --> 12:09.638
No excuses!

12:09.917 --> 12:12.270
I'll arrest you for obstruction of justice!

12:12.503 --> 12:13.712
Name and address?

12:13.713 --> 12:15.297
I told you last time.

12:15.631 --> 12:17.340
Don't talk back to me!

12:17.341 --> 12:23.471
I'll treat you for free if you let me go today.

12:23.681 --> 12:25.029
What...

12:25.266 --> 12:27.308
Trying to bribe a policeman?

12:27.813 --> 12:28.768
That's a crime!

12:28.769 --> 12:29.686
Hey!

12:29.687 --> 12:30.353
Hey!

12:30.486 --> 12:32.814
Clear the traffic already!

12:32.815 --> 12:35.233
How long do I need to wait here?!

12:35.234 --> 12:36.234
A-All right!

12:38.070 --> 12:40.214
I wrote my contact info here.

12:41.365 --> 12:42.944
I'll let you go for today.

12:43.325 --> 12:44.784
I won't be so easy next time.

12:44.785 --> 12:45.410
Now go!

12:48.539 --> 12:53.593
Geez! It's always cocky people who
cause all the traffic accidents!

13:13.230 --> 13:14.825
H-H-H-H-H-H-His head?!

13:14.858 --> 13:15.982
His head?! His head?! His head?!

13:19.069 --> 13:22.447
Damn. How could they...

13:22.581 --> 13:24.178
Did it hurt bad?

13:27.745 --> 13:32.689
If you're a policeman too, why do you let them
beat you up instead of fighting back?

13:33.667 --> 13:35.889
I guess there's no use in complaining to you.

13:38.088 --> 13:38.914
Fine.

13:39.590 --> 13:42.777
It's my day off tomorrow, so I'll stay here and protect you.

13:42.968 --> 13:45.442
And I'll capture those who keep doing this!

13:45.763 --> 13:47.293
Damn heartless thugs!

14:22.591 --> 14:24.145
Man, it's hot.

14:25.135 --> 14:30.572
And you keep standing there in the
scorching sun with no breaks.

14:36.230 --> 14:37.665
.This one's on me.

14:55.940 --> 15:00.879
Ocharaka. Ocharaka. Ocharaka. Hoi.

14:55.940 --> 15:00.820
It's a song that goes with a game involving rock, paper, scissors.

15:23.319 --> 15:25.486
What's this can doing here?

15:26.071 --> 15:28.887
He's really trying to help this statue out.

15:29.158 --> 15:31.075
Doesn't he have any friends?

15:31.702 --> 15:33.912
He wouldn't, knowing him.

15:34.194 --> 15:38.492
But because he's who he is, I got fired.

15:39.585 --> 15:40.735
Take him down!

15:53.641 --> 15:54.662
Hey!

15:55.100 --> 15:57.644
You're all under arrest!

15:57.645 --> 15:58.603
Damn!

15:58.604 --> 15:59.312
Run!

15:59.730 --> 16:00.878
Wait!

16:03.150 --> 16:04.108
Dammit!

16:07.154 --> 16:09.065
Wait! You thugs!

16:11.700 --> 16:13.159
He's still coming after us!

16:13.160 --> 16:15.286
He's so persistent!

16:13.498 --> 16:16.162
Stop!

16:44.762 --> 16:46.835
Central Hospital

16:50.155 --> 16:52.448
Will my son be all right?

16:53.075 --> 16:55.368
He got hit in some bad places, ma'am.

16:55.369 --> 16:58.615
We're doing our best but...

16:58.997 --> 17:00.172
Oh no...

17:00.416 --> 17:02.250
Please save him!

17:02.251 --> 17:03.459
Please!

17:03.794 --> 17:04.794
Please!

17:04.962 --> 17:06.546
Please!

17:06.547 --> 17:07.964
Yes, we will.

17:13.345 --> 17:15.805
What do you think, Dr. Black Jack?

17:17.349 --> 17:20.529
The skull is damaged right next
to the superior sagittal sinus.

17:20.811 --> 17:23.868
so it may start bleeding heavily
as soon we open it up.

17:25.357 --> 17:26.676
It's going to be a major operation.

17:27.568 --> 17:31.696
We didn't expect you to show up.

17:32.239 --> 17:37.741
We had a hard time believing he was carrying
an actual note with your name on it.

17:38.120 --> 17:41.080
And are you,sure you'll do it for free?

17:41.081 --> 17:41.641
Yes.

17:41.874 --> 17:44.886
I promised l'd treat him for free if he got hurt.

17:46.587 --> 17:47.815
The statue...

17:48.505 --> 17:49.592
Please...

17:50.424 --> 17:54.122
Fix him...

18:03.562 --> 18:08.232
Heavy bleeding is likely, so please be prepared
to make a sizable blood transfusion.

18:09.151 --> 18:09.792
Brain waves?

18:10.194 --> 18:11.703
All normal.

18:32.382 --> 18:34.221
Commencing operation.

18:46.021 --> 18:46.938
Suction.

19:00.077 --> 19:01.009
He's...

19:01.870 --> 19:04.934
still down...

19:05.207 --> 19:06.040
Please...

19:06.041 --> 19:09.466
Fix him...

19:13.966 --> 19:15.883
You're finally awake!

19:23.433 --> 19:25.643
I'm so glad.

19:26.478 --> 19:31.858
When you were brought in, the doctors
were saying that you may not make it.

19:32.122 --> 19:33.171
I heard.

19:33.497 --> 19:35.820
I guess it was really close.

19:36.613 --> 19:39.666
I heard why you got hurt too.

19:39.908 --> 19:42.285
I'm such an idiot.

19:42.870 --> 19:45.377
A traffic cop getting in an accident like that...

19:46.488 --> 19:50.676
Everyone around me talks about how strange I act.

19:51.211 --> 19:53.203
You're strange?

19:53.547 --> 19:54.452
Why?

19:56.049 --> 19:58.756
I think you're very kind.

19:59.094 --> 20:03.697
You kept talking in your sleep about
fixing that police statue.

20:07.460 --> 20:09.900
I'd like to see it.

20:10.731 --> 20:13.191
Would you take me there when you get better?

20:13.192 --> 20:14.069
Yes!

20:14.401 --> 20:18.059
Suzuta-san! You shouldn't be getting up yet!

20:15.152 --> 20:18.059
Ocharaka. Ocharaka. Ocharaka...

20:25.078 --> 20:26.459
Is that the statue?

20:26.747 --> 20:27.456
Yes.

20:32.336 --> 20:34.087
It's all clean and fixed!

20:36.882 --> 20:39.247
I can't see any joints either.

20:39.760 --> 20:41.573
I wonder who fixed him?

20:42.930 --> 20:45.279
Hey brother, how are you?

20:45.766 --> 20:47.962
And how are you?

20:49.937 --> 20:51.283
Dr. Black Jack!

20:51.813 --> 20:55.365
I was originally thinking it'd be for a scratch or something,

20:55.817 --> 20:57.552
but it ended up being something serious.

20:58.612 --> 21:00.238
The treatment cost ¥50,000,000.

21:01.671 --> 21:06.494
But since we made a deal, it's free.

21:08.497 --> 21:10.828
Thank you, Doctor.

21:11.208 --> 21:15.670
Well, I was the one who suggested the deal about
treating you for free when you got hurt.

21:15.671 --> 21:16.712
I couldn't help it.

21:18.215 --> 21:19.882
Here's your bill.

21:19.883 --> 21:20.695
Bill?

21:20.926 --> 21:22.715
¥150,000 for the treatment.

21:23.220 --> 21:24.637
This one's separate.

21:25.263 --> 21:26.608
¥150,000?

21:27.214 --> 21:29.049
The cost of fixing that statue.

21:30.644 --> 21:33.729
You sent him in to be fixed?

21:33.891 --> 21:34.507
Yes.

21:34.940 --> 21:38.943
You kept talking in your sleep, begging for it to be fixed.

21:40.946 --> 21:43.614
You better be grateful to that statue.

21:43.719 --> 21:47.253
It's what brought the two of you together.

21:48.662 --> 21:49.724
You're getting married, aren't you?

21:51.623 --> 21:54.959
You'll get more gifts of money for your wedding,
so you should have no problem paying it!

21:54.960 --> 21:57.420
Yup. No problem.

22:10.544 --> 22:17.550
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.544 --> 22:17.550
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.551 --> 22:24.723
Only look straight at me.

22:17.551 --> 22:24.723
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.768 --> 22:32.025
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.768 --> 22:32.025
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.026 --> 22:42.535
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.026 --> 22:42.535
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.536 --> 22:47.916
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.536 --> 22:47.916
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.917 --> 22:57.300
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.917 --> 22:53.122
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.577 --> 22:57.301
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.301 --> 23:08.061
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.301 --> 23:08.061
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.062 --> 23:13.149
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.062 --> 23:13.149
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.150 --> 23:26.120
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.150 --> 23:26.120
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.121 --> 23:33.044
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.121 --> 23:33.044
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.045 --> 23:43.930
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.045 --> 23:36.978
sora no hate tooku

23:37.071 --> 23:43.871
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.012 --> 24:15.082
The Miracle of an Operation and a Movie

23:45.125 --> 23:48.258
I wonder if I can accept such an honor.

23:48.692 --> 23:51.746
Because I'm a murderer.

23:51.798 --> 23:52.485
Collagen disease...

23:52.592 --> 23:55.703
You once saved a man who had this.

23:55.879 --> 23:57.099
You performed a miracle.

23:59.464 --> 24:00.771
How about ¥500,000,000?

24:00.971 --> 24:02.144
Now we're getting to the difficult part.

24:02.398 --> 24:05.031
If you want to make a textbook out of
this, you better take good pictures.

24:05.231 --> 24:05.958
Wow...

24:06.010 --> 24:06.637
Miracle...

24:06.731 --> 24:09.615
A movie that can save people..

24:09.815 --> 24:11.450
That's what I'm going to make.

24:11.643 --> 24:14.156
Next Karte - The Miracle of an Operation and a Movie.

24:16.168 --> 24:17.772
Karte NG...

24:21.590 --> 24:22.478
His head! His head!

24:22.514 --> 24:23.675
It's completely wrong!

24:23.774 --> 24:24.541
All wrong!
